+### 8.4 Run the Tests
+
+8K input, 1K output, and no prefix-cache hit:

 ```shell
-export DATA_NUM=8
-export CONCURRENCY=8
-
-vllm bench serve \
-  --base-url http://<SERVICE_HOST>:<SERVICE_PORT> \
-  --endpoint /v1/completions \
-  --model kimi-k3 \
-  --tokenizer <KIMI_K3_MODEL_PATH> \
-  --tokenizer-mode kimi_k3 \
-  --trust-remote-code \
